title: repos:load
tags: [[GUI command]] Repository
kind: reference
summary: Repos: pick a folder and load the repository in it

Asks how to load — `on-disk`, the ordinary load, or `in-memory`, its store held in memory ([[Holding a repository in memory]]) — then opens a folder picker and loads the repository in the folder picked — the [[repos panel]]'s ''Load repo…'' without its form. Cancelling loads nothing; a folder that is no repository is said in the status bar ([[Creating and loading a repository]]).
